#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.report_sa_lpo_ue
msgid ""
"<b>\"The Client\"</b> authorizes <b>\"PAOMX\"</b> to request the information it considers pertinent before granting the \n"
"                            certification in case it has been previously certified by another certification body."
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.report_sa_lpo_ue
msgid ""
"<b>\"The Client\"</b> authorizes <b>\"PAOMX\"</b> under the terms of this instrument, to transfer its file if there is a \n"
"                            change of certification body or, in case of withdrawal from organic production, to keep the control file \n"
"                            for five years."
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.report_sa_lpo_ue
msgid ""
"<b>\"The Client\"</b> authorizes the exchange of information between certification bodies in case subcontractors are \n"
"                            subject to controls by different certification bodies."
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.report_sa_lpo_ue
msgid ""
"<b>\"The Client\"</b> undertakes to inform the purchasers of the products in writing without undue delay and to exchange \n"
"                            relevant information with the supervisory authority or <b>\"PAOMX\"</b>, if a suspicion of non-compliance is proven, \n"
"                            that such suspicion cannot be ruled out, or that a non-compliance affecting the integrity of the products in \n"
"                            question is proven."
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.report_sa_lpo_ue
msgid ""
"<b>\"The Client\"</b> undertakes, if required, to provide to importers, control authorities or control bodies of \n"
"                            importers and national authorities of the Union and of those third countries, all the information necessary \n"
"                            to identify the operators who are its suppliers and the control authorities or control bodies of those suppliers, \n"
"                            to ensure the traceability of the organic or in-conversion product in question."
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.report_sa_lpo_ue
msgid "<b>\"The client\" declares through its representative/by its own right</b>"
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_smeta
msgid ""
"<b>10. FACTURACIÓN.</b> Se puede cobrar una tarifa administrativa de cancelación de \n"
"                                        $ 200.00 por cualquier cancelación de auditoría dentro de los 21 días posteriores a \n"
"                                        la fecha de auditoría programada. Esta tarifa de cancelación excluye cualquier gasto \n"
"                                        adicional relacionado con el viaje y la mano de obra si se incurre en él. El Cliente \n"
"                                        acepta pagar a Primus Auditing Ops dentro de los 30 días posteriores a la facturación.\n"
"                                        <br/>\n"
"                                        <br/>\n"
"                                        <b>11. LOGO y URN.</b> El uso del logos de miembro de Sedex se encuentra en el sitio web \n"
"                                        (www.sedex.com) en la sección <u>Sedex Ambassador toolkit.</u> El cliente no debe hacer un \n"
"                                        mal uso del informe SMETA, CAPR y / o URN."
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_smeta_usa
msgid "<b>10. TERM AND TERMINATION.</b>"
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_sustentabilidad
msgid ""
"<b>11 PAGO Y CANCELACIONES.</b>\n"
"            El Cliente acepta pagar Primus Auditing Ops dentro de los 30 días\n"
"            posteriores a la facturación. Todos los servicios prestados por\n"
"            Primus Auditing Ops se proporcionan de forma no reembolsable. El\n"
"            cliente reconoce que Primus Auditing Ops hará todo lo posible para\n"
"            garantizar que todas las facturas se emitan correctamente. Sin embargo,\n"
"            si el Cliente observa cualquier posible error, el Cliente acepta\n"
"            notificar a nuestro Departamento de Facturación dentro de los 10 días\n"
"            posteriores a la emisión de la factura errónea.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <b>12. MODIFICACIONES.</b>\n"
"            Este Acuerdo, junto con el apéndice \"A\" adjunto, constituye la totalidad\n"
"            del Acuerdo con respecto al tema contenido en este documento. Ninguna\n"
"            enmienda o extensión de este Acuerdo será vinculante para ninguna de\n"
"            las partes a menos que se realice por escrito y esté firmada por ambas\n"
"            partes.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>"
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_sustentabilidad_usa
msgid ""
"<b>11 PAYMENT AND CANCELLATIONS.</b>\n"
"            The Customer agrees to pay Primus Auditing Ops within 30 days of billing. All services rendered by Primus Auditing Ops are \n"
"            provided on a non-refundable basis. Customer acknowledges that Primus Auditing Ops will make its best effort to ensure that \n"
"            all invoices are correctly issued. However, should Customer note any possible errors, Customer agrees to notify our Billing \n"
"            Department within 10 days of the issuance of the errant invoice.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <b>12. MODIFICATIONS.</b>\n"
"            This Agreement, along with the attached addendum “A', constitutes the entirety of the Agreement with regard to the subject \n"
"            matter contained herein. No amendment or extension of this Agreement shall be binding on either party unless in writing and \n"
"            signed by both parties.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>"
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_smeta_usa
msgid "<b>11. BILLING.</b>"
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_smeta_usa
msgid ""
"<b>12. CANCELLATION FEES. </b>If Customer cancels or otherwise reschedules a scheduled audit date, it acknowledges, \n"
"                understands, and agrees that Customer shall be responsible for all non-refundable travel costs incurred by Primus Auditing \n"
"                Ops associated with that audit. In addition to any incurred travel costs, any change or cancellation of an audit by \n"
"                Customer that occurs within 15 business days of the scheduled audit will be charged a cancellation fee of 50% of the audit. \n"
"                If, on the day of the audit, the auditor or any representative of Primus Auditing Ops is denied access to the field, \n"
"                facilities, or any area necessary to perform the audit, Customer understands, acknowledges, and agrees that it shall be \n"
"                responsible for all audit fees quoted herein, in addition to all travel costs."
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_gfs
msgid ""
"<b>12. FACTURACIÓN.</b> El Cliente está de acuerdo con \n"
"                                            emitir el pago a Primus Auditing Ops dentro de los 30 días \n"
"                                            después de recibida la factura.\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            <br/>\n"
"                                            Fecha:"
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_gfs_usa
msgid ""
"<b>12. The Customer agrees to pay Primus Auditing Ops within 30 days of billing.</b> All services rendered by the Company are \n"
"                provided on a non-refundable basis. Customer acknowledges that the Company will make its best effort to ensure that all \n"
"                invoices are correctly issued. However, should Customer note any possible errors, Customer agrees to notify our Billing \n"
"                Department within 10 days of the issuance of the errant invoice. After 10 days, all invoices will be assumed to be correct, \n"
"                and no further billing adjustments will be made.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
