#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_gfs_usa
msgid ""
"<u><b>Termination by Customer.</b></u> Desktop Review Portion of Audit. If Customer voluntarily terminates this \n"
"                    Agreement in accordance with Section 10.b. above, but after Primus Auditing Ops has begun the Desktop Review portion \n"
"                    of the Audit, Customer acknowledges and agrees that it shall be responsible for, and pay to Primus Auditing Ops, an \n"
"                    amount equal to ONE-THIRD (1/3) of the Audit Fee indicated in the “Audit Fee/Total Services” box on page 1 of the \n"
"                    Agreement. Failure on Customer's behalf to do so is a material breach of this Agreement by Customer."
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_gfs_usa
msgid ""
"<u><b>Termination for Cause.</b></u> This Service Agreement and the sublicense for use of the PrimusGFS trademark \n"
"                granted herein shall be indefinite, ending at the time of expiration of Customer's Certification. If either party fails \n"
"                to fulfill any term or condition of this Agreement, such failure shall be considered a breach of this Agreement. \n"
"                The breaching party shall have 10 calendar days from the time of receipt of written notice from the other party to cure \n"
"                such breach. If after 10 days, the breaching party has not cured the breach, the non-breaching party may terminate this \n"
"                Agreement with no further obligations. The 10-day notice provision and termination is not applicable to violation of the \n"
"                Trademark use, as described in Section 9 herein - where the cure time upon notice will be 15 days."
msgstr ""

#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_gfs_usa
msgid ""
"<u><b>Voluntary Termination.</b></u> Either party may voluntarily terminate this Agreement upon fifteen days' written \n"
"                    notice to the other party. If this Agreement is terminated by party, all sublicenses and certifications granted by \n"
"                    Primus Audit Ops to Customer after such termination shall not be valid. Subject to Section 10.c. below, either party \n"
"                    may voluntarily terminate this Agreement upon fifteen days' written notice to the other party. If this Agreement is \n"
"                    terminated by Customer, all sublicenses and certifications granted by Primus Auditing Ops to Customer hereunder shall \n"
"                    not be valid past the date of Termination."
msgstr ""

