#. module: servicereferralagreement
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:servicereferralagreement.sa_sustentabilidad_usa
msgid ""
"Estimated Travel Expenses: - Travel expenses are estimated and are subject to change based on actual travel expenses incurred.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"            Travel expenses are on a direct reimbursement basis and include all expenses for transportation, accommodation and meals. \n"
"            Whenever possible trips are combined with other business and expenses are divided to reduce the total cost for all of \n"
"            our customers.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"            <b>1. SERVICES and DELIVERY.</b> Primus Auditing Ops shall perform and inspection and Audit of Customer's operations, against \n"
"            the Sustainable Food Group Sustainability Standard Scheme, and compliant with the Sustainability Standard General Regulations, \n"
"            and utilizing an approved auditor from or contracted by Primus Auditing Ops. Within 15 days following the inspection of the \n"
"            operation, Primus Auditing Ops shall provide results of the Inspection and Audit to Customer, indicating where corrective \n"
"            actions can or must be made by Customer. Customer shall have thirty (30) calendar days following the date of the inspection to \n"
"            send the applicable corrective actions to PAO utilizing the Azzule Auditing Software. If Customer fails to submit corrective \n"
"            actions within that 30 day window, the audit is considered closed and there will be no possibility to modify Customer's level \n"
"            of compliance.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"            <b>Upon Customer's achievement of certification under the</b> Sustainability Standard TM and its general regulations, Primus \n"
"            Auditing Ops shall issue Customer a certificate indicating Customer's compliance with the Sustainability Standard TM audit. \n"
"            Certification is valid for the three year period following the certification date. Note that audit reports and certificates \n"
"            are sent electronically to Customer via email and will be uploaded directly by Primus Auditing Ops to the Azzule Systems \n"
"            Database. Hardcopies are available upon Customer's request.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <b>2. DATA OWNERSHIP.</b> Customer acknowledges and agrees all data submitted by Primus Auditing Ops into the Primus \n"
"                Auditing Ops database and/or Azzule Systems database becomes the sole and exclusive property of Azzule Systems \n"
"                (“Azzule”). Azzule may use Customer's data to create anonymized data sets. Data sets are not associated with any individual \n"
"                Customer. Azzule shall not share personal or identifiable information with other third parties without Customer's consent. \n"
"                Azzule reserves the right to use data for use in preparing analytics, specific statistical comparisons, generic use in \n"
"                reports, presentations and other materials.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <b>3. IDEMNIFICATION &amp; HOLD HARMLESS.</b> Customer acknowledges and agrees it shall indemnify, defend and hold Primus \n"
"                Auditing Ops, Sustainable Food Group, and Azzule Systems harmless from all claims, demands, losses, liabilities, costs, \n"
"                expenses, obligations and damages of every kind and nature, known and unknown, including reasonable legal fees associated \n"
"                with Customer's commodity and operations, irrespective of the cause or nature of the liability.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <b>4. SUBLICENSE FOR USE OF SUSTAINABILITY STANDARD TM TRADEMARK AND NAME.</b>\n"
"                Upon execution of this Agreement and the attached Addendum “A”, and after Customer receives Certification for \n"
"                their operation(s), Customer is granted a non-transferable and revocable sublicense to use the “Sustainability \n"
"                Standard TM ” and accompanying logo (collectively “Sustainability Standard Trademark”) in a manner consistent with \n"
"                the terms in the attached Addendum “A” and the Sustainable Food Group Sustainability Standard TM General Regulations. \n"
"                Customer's failure to comply with the requirements found in Addendum “A” and the General Regulations can result in suspension \n"
"                and/or revocation of use of the Sustainability Standard Trademark, and potentially void the agreement, all as outlined therein.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <b>5. CONFIDENTIALITY.</b>\n"
"                During the term of this Agreement, Customer and Primus Auditing Ops will come in contact with and may become familiar with \n"
"                certain information about each other's business practices, internal documentation, and other information deemed confidential \n"
"                by each party. Primus Auditing Ops will keep such confidential information about Customer confidential and shall not disclose \n"
"                it to any third parties outside of Primus Auditing Ops, Sustainable Food Group, Azzule Systems, and any other party that \n"
"                Customer requests such information be released to. Any and all information provided to Sustainable Food Group from Primus \n"
"                Auditing Ops will remain confidential with the exception of the company name of CP's, which SFG reserves the right to publish \n"
"                on the Sustainability Standard website. Likewise, Customer agrees to keep confidential information about Primus Auditing Ops \n"
"                and Sustainable Food Group, that it learns during the auditing process, confidential and will not discuss or divulge such \n"
"                information to any party other than Primus Auditing Ops and/or Sustainable Food Group. Customer further agrees not to copy, \n"
"                reproduce, disclose or publish any confidential information it comes across during the duration of Certification.\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <br/>"
msgstr ""

