"                days, following written notice from Primus Auditing Ops or the Scheme Owner of the improper use, to cure the improper use. \n"
"                If Customer fails to cure the improper use, this Agreement is voidable by Primus Auditing Ops, and Customer's certification, \n"
"                and the documents associated therewith, will be immediately revoked.\n"
